    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starfall Serenity is a relaxing game about a cat that loves watching the stars! Find the best spot, sit back, enjoy the night sky and unwind while collecting as many falling stars as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711360/extras/7c7b80c2390b8738762d80bd0de830b6.webp?t=1755089165\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted environment!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the best location to sit down and watch the falling stars!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the stars and collect Stardust!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Stardust to unlock constellations and other celestial bodies and enjoy them in the sky!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711360/extras/7c7b80c2390b8738762d80bd0de830b6.webp?t=1755089165\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starfall Serenity is a relaxing game about a cat that loves watching the stars! Find the best spot, sit back, enjoy the night sky and unwind while collecting as many falling stars as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711360/extras/7c7b80c2390b8738762d80bd0de830b6.webp?t=1755089165\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted environment!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the best location to sit down and watch the falling stars!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the stars and collect Stardust!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Stardust to unlock constellations and other celestial bodies and enjoy them in the sky!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711360/extras/7c7b80c2390b8738762d80bd0de830b6.webp?t=1755089165\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p>",
